Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:02:05.40,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 男单1/4决赛
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:05.40,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}哈恰诺夫 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}5 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}3-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 布洛克斯 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:01.66,EN,,0,0,0,,Karen, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:01.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,卡伦 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:02.55,EN,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:02.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.55,0:00:05.08,EN,,0,0,0,,this might not be the way you wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.55,0:00:05.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,这可能不是你想要的结局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:06.47,EN,,0,0,0,,to end things, but let's talk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:06.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过我们聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.47,0:00:08.55,EN,,0,0,0,,about your fitness level when you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.47,0:00:08.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,你来这儿时的身体状态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:10.67,EN,,0,0,0,,Where does all this confidence come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:10.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,这份自信是从哪来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.67,0:00:12.82,EN,,0,0,0,,There's a new Karen Khachanov.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.67,0:00:12.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,一个全新的哈恰诺夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.82,0:00:13.62,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's not new.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.82,0:00:13.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实不算新
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:16.26,EN,,0,0,0,,I'd say it's the same as always, in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:16.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,某种程度上 还是一如既往
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:17.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, look, Alex,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:17.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,是这样 Alex
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:20.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I was preparing very, very well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:20.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我准备得非常非常充分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:21.99,EN,,0,0,0,,for that confrontation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:21.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,为了这场对决
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.99,0:00:23.91,EN,,0,0,0,,It's not really easy to play
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.99,0:00:23.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场球其实不好打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.91,0:00:25.23,EN,,0,0,0,,because, on the one hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.91,0:00:25.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为一方面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:27.05,EN,,0,0,0,,I felt like I was dominating
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:27.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得自己从一开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.05,0:00:28.04,EN,,0,0,0,,from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.05,0:00:28.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,就占着上风
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:29.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Then I began to feel that he was having
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:29.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,后来我感觉到他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:30.98,EN,,0,0,0,,more and more difficulties.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:30.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,越来越吃力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:33.43,EN,,0,0,0,,And, you know, it's a mixed feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:33.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种感觉很复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.43,0:00:36.05,EN,,0,0,0,,because I feel like I'm better off, let's say,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.43,0:00:36.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为可以说 他难受的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.05,0:00:38.55,EN,,0,0,0,,in situations where he suffers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.05,0:00:38.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,我反而更占便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.55,0:00:40.63,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't want to shout "let's go"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.55,0:00:40.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不想去喊 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.63,0:00:42.23,EN,,0,0,0,,or anything like that, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.63,0:00:42.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者类似的话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:44.48,EN,,0,0,0,,and I wanted to conserve my energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:44.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也想省点力气
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:47.04,EN,,0,0,0,,but yes, I wish him a speedy recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:47.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我真心祝他早日康复
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.04,0:00:48.70,EN,,0,0,0,,I definitely saw
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.04,0:00:48.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,我看得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:52.14,EN,,0,0,0,,that he was really suffering all over his body
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:52.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,他浑身都在难受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.14,0:00:53.91,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm super happy, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.14,0:00:53.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,而我特别开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:55.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm in the semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:55.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我进四强了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:58.33,EN,,0,0,0,,Come on! Yes that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:58.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,太棒了 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.33,0:00:59.34,EN,,0,0,0,,Semifinals. Congratulations. Sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.33,0:00:59.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,半决赛 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.34,0:01:00.89,EN,,0,0,0,,this is the second time we've reached
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.34,0:01:00.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是我们第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.89,0:01:01.88,EN,,0,0,0,,the semi-finals here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.89,0:01:01.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这里打进四强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:03.52,EN,,0,0,0,,What do you feel you learned
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得从第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:04.93,EN,,0,0,0,,from the first time and are you ready
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:04.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,学到了什么 准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.93,0:01:07.03,EN,,0,0,0,,to take another step forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.93,0:01:07.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,再往前一步了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.03,0:01:08.66,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, look, we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.03,0:01:08.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 走着看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.66,0:01:09.58,EN,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.66,0:01:09.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,走着看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.58,0:01:11.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Obviously it's a goal;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.58,0:01:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,这当然是个目标
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:13.69,EN,,0,0,0,,once you're in the semi-finals, you think
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:13.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,进了四强 自然会想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.69,0:01:15.53,EN,,0,0,0,,about taking another step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.69,0:01:15.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,再往前迈一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.53,0:01:19.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I will definitely watch Sasha vs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.53,0:01:19.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我肯定会看兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.40,0:01:22.27,EN,,0,0,0,,Botic and prepare for whoever wins,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.40,0:01:22.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,对范德赞德舒尔普 谁赢备谁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.27,0:01:25.74,EN,,0,0,0,,trying to do my best, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.27,0:01:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,一如既往 尽我所能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.74,0:01:28.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I always see you giving it your all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.74,0:01:28.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我每次看你都是全力以赴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.16,0:01:29.39,EN,,0,0,0,,I always see you physically prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.16,0:01:29.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,身体状态一直很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.39,0:01:30.83,EN,,0,0,0,,It seems that the three out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.39,0:01:30.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,看起来五盘三胜制
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.83,0:01:32.46,EN,,0,0,0,,of five format is great for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.83,0:01:32.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,特别适合你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.46,0:01:34.37,EN,,0,0,0,,What kind of training do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.46,0:01:34.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,你平时怎么练的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:38.22,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever seen you tired here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:38.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,我好像没见你在这儿累过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:39.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was even thinking of going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:39.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 我刚还想着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:41.51,EN,,0,0,0,,to practice my serve a bit now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:41.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在就去练会儿发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.51,0:01:43.69,EN,,0,0,0,,because the percentage wasn't that high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.51,0:01:43.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为成功率不太高
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:44.47,EN,,0,0,0,,At the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:44.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过同时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.47,0:01:45.83,EN,,0,0,0,,I have a day off tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.47,0:01:45.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,我明天有一天休息
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:48.03,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, a recovery and practice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:48.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,是恢复加训练的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.03,0:01:51.31,EN,,0,0,0,,I definitely don't like having days off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.03,0:01:51.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,我实在不喜欢休息日
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.31,0:01:53.44,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, once you're in this rhythm,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.31,0:01:53.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,一旦进入这个节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.44,0:01:55.07,EN,,0,0,0,,in this dynamic, in this momentum,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.44,0:01:55.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,这种势头里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.07,0:01:57.05,EN,,0,0,0,,you want to keep going unless it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.07,0:01:57.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,就想一直打下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.05,0:01:59.45,EN,,0,0,0,,was a really tough game where you say,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.05,0:01:59.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,除非那场特别苦 你会说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.45,0:02:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,"Okay, I can't even get up." Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.45,0:02:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,好吧 我都爬不起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:02.69,EN,,0,0,0,,congratulations,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:02.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.69,0:02:04.06,EN,,0,0,0,,semi-finalist Karen Khachanov.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.69,0:02:04.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,打进四强的哈恰诺夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:06.75,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:06.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家 谢谢
